---
// Hero component for Pricing page
---

<section class="pt-32 pb-20 bg-gradient-to-b from-gray-950 to-gray-900 relative overflow-hidden">
  <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-10">
    <div class="absolute top-16 left-1/3 w-80 h-80 bg-green-400 rounded-full blur-3xl"></div>
    <div class="absolute bottom-0 right-1/4 w-96 h-96 bg-emerald-500 rounded-full blur-3xl"></div>
  </div>
  <div class="container mx-auto px-4 relative z-10">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center">
      <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-1.5 bg-green-500/10 border border-green-500/20 text-green-400 text-sm font-medium rounded-full mb-6">
        <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
          <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M4 4a2 2 0 00-2 2v4a2 2 0 002 2V6h10a2 2 0 00-2-2H4zm2 6a2 2 0 012-2h8a2 2 0 012 2v4a2 2 0 01-2 2H8a2 2 0 01-2-2v-4zm6 4a2 2 0 100-4 2 2 0 000 4z" clip-rule="evenodd"/>
        </svg>
        Precios Transparentes
      </span>
      <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold text-white mb-6 leading-tight">
        Planes que crecen<br/>
        <span class="text-green-400">con tu negocio</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="text-gray-400 text-lg leading-relaxed max-w-xl mx-auto mb-10">
        Sin costos ocultos. Sin sorpresas. Elige el plan que mejor se adapta al tamaño y necesidades de tu farmacia.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-6 text-sm text-gray-400">
        {[
          { icon: "✓", text: "Cancela cuando quieras" },
          { icon: "✓", text: "Sin contrato de permanencia" },
          { icon: "✓", text: "Soporte incluido en todos los planes" },
        ].map(item => (
          <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
            <span class="text-green-500 font-bold">{item.icon}</span>
            {item.text}
          </span>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
